Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:36.28,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}終わりが来たら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:38.53,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}なんて言おう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:41.66,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どうせなら　ほら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:43.87,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}哀しくない様に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:49.75,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}いつかのあなたの言葉が
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.25,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}酷く刺さってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.25,0:01:58.09,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:08.94,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}知れば知るだけでいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:11.11,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何かを求めてしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.65,0:02:12.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}大丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:14.53,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どこにも行かないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.61,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どこにも行けないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:21.24,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}忘れないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:26.70,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何故か遠くなる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:33.17,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}瞳の裏にいつも君は居る
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:37.63,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}今も　ずっとそう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:40.09,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}いつかね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.09,0:02:41.22,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}もう少しね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:45.52,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}世界に優しい風が吹いたら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:49.60,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何か変わるのでしょうか
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:52.27,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}「帰りたい場所がある」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:55.11,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}誰もがこの星の子孫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:56.57,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}約束はね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:02:57.99,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}大事にね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:02.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:36.28,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}倘若终结将降临
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:38.53,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}那该说些什么才好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:41.66,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}倒不如像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:43.87,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}装作不曾悲伤的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:49.75,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}往昔你说过的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.25,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}深深地刺痛着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.25,0:01:58.09,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}但温暖犹存
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:08.94,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}明明知晓便已足够
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:11.11,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}却总是渴求着更多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.65,0:02:12.48,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:14.53,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}我哪里都不会去的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.61,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}其实我也无处可去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:21.24,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}分明从未遗忘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:26.70,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}却为何渐行渐远
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:33.17,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}你始终存于我眼眸的深处
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:37.63,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}至今 一直如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:40.09,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.09,0:02:41.22,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}再稍等片刻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:45.52,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}如果世间吹起温柔的风
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:49.60,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}是否会发生改变
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:52.27,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}「总有想要回去的地方」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:55.11,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}人人都是这颗星球的子孙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:56.57,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}而约定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:02:57.99,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}可要好好珍惜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:02.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}温暖犹存
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.23,0:22:21.90,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}So don't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.98,0:22:26.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたに知らないように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:31.33,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたを守れますように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.74,0:22:37.29,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}The story has only just begun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:40.04,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あてのない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.09,0:22:44.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}道なき道にいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.59,0:22:49.47,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}迷いながらいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:57.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}希望が　そこにあるよ　ともにあるよ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.44,0:22:59.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,1030)}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:23:02.32,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}どこにいでも行ける羽を
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.98,0:23:04.57,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,1030)}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.73,0:23:06.24,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたに授けたの
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.24,0:23:13.20,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}どんな闇も晴らしてしまえるように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.41,0:23:17.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}You gave me holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.37,0:23:21.96,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}恐れず進めよ　Oh holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.96,0:23:26.30,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}振り返ればいつも　Holy trace
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.30,0:23:30.43,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたが笑ってた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.51,0:23:35.56,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}だから　Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.56,0:23:40.06,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}躓きながらでも　Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.06,0:23:44.44,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}私は踏み出せる　遠くへ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.44,0:23:48.99,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}あなたがいる場所へ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.23,0:22:21.90,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}所以不要担心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.98,0:22:26.45,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}愿不会被你察觉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:31.33,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}愿默默守护着你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.74,0:22:37.29,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}故事才刚刚拉开序幕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:40.04,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}纵使是在望不到尽头的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.09,0:22:44.51,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}举步维艰时也请相信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.59,0:22:49.47,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}踌躇不定时也请相信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:57.23,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}希望就在那里 与我们相伴
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.44,0:22:59.94,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,50)}我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:23:02.32,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}将能飞向万千世界的羽翼
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.98,0:23:04.57,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,50)}我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.73,0:23:06.24,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}授予你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.24,0:23:13.20,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}愿它能助你划破一切黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.41,0:23:17.37,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}你赐予了我神圣的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.37,0:23:21.96,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}让我不惧一切地前行 神圣的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.96,0:23:26.30,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}每当回首都是条 光明之路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.30,0:23:30.43,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}都有你的笑容相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.51,0:23:35.56,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}所以 神圣的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.56,0:23:40.06,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}即便是几经坎坷 神圣的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.06,0:23:44.44,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}我都会迈向远方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.44,0:23:48.99,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}向着有你在的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:49.07,PZ,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,PZ,,0,0,0,,
